		<content type="html" xml:base="http://localhost/opengd77/viewtopic.php?t=4052&amp;p=31226#p31226"><![CDATA[
A new Alpha version is now available<br><br>See<br><br><a href="https://www.opengd77.com/downloads/MD2017/Firmware/045d43e01bcbf6d6933a2085faffff713db60329" class="postlink">downloads/MD2017/Firmware/045d43e01bcbf ... 713db60329</a><br><br>This version has the following changes<br><br>* Fixes problem with satellite APRS frequencies<br>* Adds Safe Boot mode (SK1 + 0) to be used when the radio will not bootup or bootloops.<br>* Updates translations<br>* Fixes scan frequencies range boundary display problem<br>* Fixes voice prompt problem when replaying a prompt<br>* Fixes possible hanging problems associated with I2Cinternal bus contention<br>* Workaround for bugs in the C6000 DMR chip<br><br>All these changes were made by Daniel F1RMB, so thanks goes to him and the varoius translators and people who have reported bugs and helped Daniel test his fixes<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=50">VK3KYY</a> — Sat May 11, 2024 7:36 am</p><hr />
]]></content>
